{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/933125-met-werewolf-the-apocalypse-omega-slice-is-out","id":933125,"title":"MET: Werewolf the Apocalypse Omega slice is out","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-17T16:13:29-07:00","id":933125,"title":"MET: Werewolf the Apocalypse Omega slice is out","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/188374/Minds-Eye-Theatre-Werewolf-The-Apocalypse-Omega-Slice-Playtest-Rules\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/188374/Minds-Eye-Theatre-Werewolf-The-Apocalypse-Omega-Slice-Playtest-Rules\" target=\"_blank\"> - | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/188374/Minds-Eye-Theatre-Werewolf-The-Apocalypse-Omega-Slice-Playtest-Rules\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/188374/Minds-Eye-Theatre-Werewolf-The-Apocalypse-Omega-Slice-Playtest-Rules </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> - </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Some initial thoughts;<br /> <br /> Hey, I like the way derangements are written. They feel much better than the ones used in revised.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-24T06:31:31-07:00","id":936519,"title":"","content":"So, I listened to the PDF, focusing on the tribe section. Here are some thoughts;<br /> <br /> <b>Good;</b><ul><li>-No mentions of the Bite anymore.</li> <li>-Silver Fang weakness has changed. Now you pick two flaws and gain no dots from them. I like this, because they don't -have- to be mentally effed up and the player has more control over how the inbreeding manifests.</li> <li>-Wendigo weakness is now being more likely to commit cannibalism. Given their totem spirit, this is fitting.</li> <li>-Stargazers actually have some successes and new perspectives.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <b>Bad;</b><ul><li>-Male Black Furies, still. At least they are part of the Sanctum of Gaia. Still, given the nature of the tribe, it just feels wrong to allow men in. Transwomen, yes, but for them the argument is easily that their spirit was always a woman.</li> <li>- The Fenrir are written as only recently quitting their racism and still hating metis. Given the good amount of info the writers picked from the TBs, they seem to have ignored the Fenrir entirely.</li> <li>-Speaking of the Fenrir, the Valkyria camp now accepts men too. This is just utterly baffling to me. If the tribe IS written as sexist and such, why should the camp focused on combating that include men? Are there so many more men compared to women in LARP circles that usually women only things are hard to do?</li> <li>-Sanctum of Gaia tribes, minus Red Talons, still hold jobs that make no sense for a technology disliking and traditionalist tribes.</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-26T04:13:17-07:00","id":937544,"title":"","content":"I looked into it, and as far as I saw, it is only the character creation rules for the BNS LARP in New Orleans. So, no direct info on Setting or Background in it, just rules - and what ever you can read between the lines.... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}